es":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Tragedy! Santa; the toy giving folk-hero, and purveyor of fine Christmas goods, has had enough. Endless requests from greedy children wanting more and more every year, tax increases, pressure from elf unions, bills, reindeer!","detailedDescription":"Tragedy! Santa; the toy giving folk-hero, and purveyor of fine Christmas goods, has had enough. Endless requests from greedy children wanting more and more every year, tax increases, pressure from elf unions, bills, reindeer!\n\nIt is your duty, as an employee of Polar Sanitation Inc, to clean up the grizzly aftermath of Santa's bloody rampage. Elves, reindeer and ruined masonry from Santa's brief breakdown are all strewn across his famous workshop.\n\nSo don your cap, grab your mop, and get this place sorted out so the company can get a replacement in here ASAP, and restore Christmas for another generation!\nKey Features\n\n• Janitorial Simulation - Step into the boots of a space-station (or in this case, North pole) sanitation technician and experience the highs and lows of the job.\n\n• Santa's Workshop - Explore Santa's infamous workshop and discover the story that lead up to the tragic events you're here to clean up.\n\n• Clean - It's your job to clean up the mess, so clean it up you shall! Use your trusty mop, gloves, dispenser machines and sniffer tool to help you get all that blood out of the floor! You can even try and punch-out if you think you've done your job.\n\n• Sandbox Gameplay - Don't want to clean? Just want to make more of a mess and play around with the physics? Go ahead!\n\n• Multiplayer - You can even enlist some friends/coworkers to come and help you clean up (or make even more mess). Split-screen co-op is available too!\n\nNote for Viscera Cleanup Detail purchasers: A Steam key for 'Viscera Cleanup Detail: Santa's Rampage' is provided for FREE to anyone who purchases (or had already pre-ordered) 'Viscera Cleanup Detail', either on the Steam Store or via the Humble Widget on our site.\nAlso note that Santa's Rampage comes included with the main game download of Viscera Cleanup Detail","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/265210/header.jpg?t=1666984014"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/265210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1666984014"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/265210/ss_c17c44ba05859b3e5fbae4cd15c25b8b764760aa.600x338.jpg?t=1666984014","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/265210/ss_c17c44ba05859b3e5fbae4cd15c25b8b764760aa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1666984014"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/265210/ss_a411e1710a450a2f6a549dca9e9b0fbcc1dacbb4.600x338.jpg?t=1666984014","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/265210/ss_a411e1710a450a2f6a549dca9e9b0fbcc1dacbb4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1666984014"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/265210/ss_c8b50d5f41b73235fe440fe33661a2bc3b2c53cf.600x338.jpg?t=1666984014","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/265210/ss_c8b50d5f41b73235fe440fe33661a2bc3b2c53cf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1666984014"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/265210/ss_f8339e3f203e5f7bc7ae3bab64d515e06ef2cabc.600x338.jpg?t=1666984014","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/265210/ss_f8339e3f203e5f7bc7ae3bab64d515e06ef2cabc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1666984014"},{"id":4,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/265210/ss_c5d5607ab6080ea10c355